# boulder_a: a small boulder (BUILD_PLAN S5 brief B5): a rounded slate (2)
# body, its top-right facet lit glacier blue (3) by the high south-west sun,
# an ink (0) line of shadow where it sits on the ground, as on the cover.
# Drawn row by row as whole shapes, so no lone pixel reads as an eye. The
# anchor, 0,0, is the middle of its ground line. 5 wide, 4 tall.
C 2  L -1,-3  L -2,-2 -1,-2  L -2,-1 1,-1
C 3  L 0,-3 1,-3  L 0,-2 2,-2  L 2,-1
C 0  L -2,0 2,0
